---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Editorial Policy" description="Editorial Policy of Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — how we research, verify and correct our content.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Editorial Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 26 November 2026</p>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<h2>Our standard</h2>
			<p>We publish only information we can verify. If we cannot verify a job, deadline, fee or statistic, we do not publish it — we link to the official source instead.</p>
			<h2>Sources</h2>
			<p>Our primary sources are official websites: government portals (jobs.gov.pk, njp.gov.pk, ppsc.gop.pk, fpsc.gov.pk), NAVTTC, DigiSkills, HEC, and the platforms themselves (Coursera, Google Skillshop, Microsoft Learn, freeCodeCamp, Khan Academy, Upwork, Fiverr, Freelancer, LinkedIn). Every opportunity shows its source URL and verification date.</p>
			<h2>Original content</h2>
			<p>Our guides are original. We do not copy or paraphrase other publishers' articles. Where we describe a platform or programme, we write it in our own words from the official source.</p>
			<h2>No invented facts</h2>
			<p>We never invent jobs, salaries, deadlines, statistics, testimonials or expert credentials. Salaries are shown only when officially published; otherwise we say so.</p>
			<h2>No guaranteed income</h2>
			<p>We never describe a platform as guaranteed income. We explain real fees, real requirements and real risks.</p>
			<h2>Advertising and sponsorship</h2>
			<p>Advertising and sponsored content are always labelled. Sponsors do not influence our editorial content or our verification of listings.</p>
			<h2>Corrections</h2>
			<p>When we get something wrong, we correct it promptly and transparently. See our <a href="/corrections-policy">Corrections Policy</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
